cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "ThermoRegister: temperature acquisition system for solution combustion synthesis"
abstract: "Hardware design, firmware and CAD files to reproduce the low-cost temperature measurement system used in the paper 'Influence of Ammonium Nitrate in the Synthesis of Alpha Tricalcium Phosphates (α-TCP) in One Step by Solution Combustion' (International Journal of Self-Propagating High-Temperature Synthesis, 2023, 32(3), 192-199). The system records the reaction temperature with two type-K thermocouples and an infrared sensor."
authors:
